---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="How it works — RHO Navigator"
  description="What the RHO Navigator does: the support and resistance channel it draws, the buy, sell and breakout signals, and the weekly webinar that comes with a subscription."
>

  <span id="top"></span>

  <!-- ============ HERO ============ -->
  <section class="hiw-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span>How it works</span>
      <h1>This is the Navigator <span class="hl">on a real chart</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">The RHO Navigator draws the floor, the ceiling and the middle line on your chart, then prints a plain buy or sell label the moment price reacts. Here is what that looks like on a trader's screen. Watch what it does at the floor, at the ceiling, and on a break.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ THE SCREEN (over-the-shoulder demo) ============ -->
  <section class="screen-wrap" id="setups" aria-label="Live demonstration of the Navigator on a chart">
    <div class="container">

      <!-- standalone tab strip ABOVE the monitor frame -->
      <div class="setup-strip">
        <span class="strip-eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span>Three setups the Navigator looks for</span>
        <h2>Pick a setup and watch it play out <span class="hl">on the chart</span></h2>
        <div class="setup-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Three Navigator setups">
          <button class="setup-tab buy" role="tab" id="tab-buy" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="panel-buy" data-set="buy">
            <span class="st-ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 16l5-5 4 3 5-7"/><path d="M17 7h4v4"/></svg></span>
            <span class="st-text"><span class="st-title">Buy the rebound</span><span class="st-sub">at the floor</span></span>
          </button>
          <button class="setup-tab sell" role="tab" id="tab-sell" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="panel-sell" data-set="sell" tabindex="-1">
            <span class="st-ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 8l5 5 4-3 5 7"/><path d="M17 17h4v-4"/></svg></span>
            <span class="st-text"><span class="st-title">Sell the pullback</span><span class="st-sub">at the ceiling</span></span>
          </button>
          <button class="setup-tab brk" role="tab" id="tab-brk" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="panel-brk" data-set="brk" tabindex="-1">
            <span class="st-ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 15h16" stroke-dasharray="3 3"/><path d="M12 5v8"/><path d="M8 9l4-4 4 4"/></svg></span>
            <span class="st-text"><span class="st-title">Catch the breakout</span><span class="st-sub">on a break</span></span>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="screen">
        <!-- browser bar -->
        <div class="screen-bar">
          <div class="dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
          <span class="screen-url">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="10" width="16" height="10" rx="2"/><path d="M8 10V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3"/></svg>
            tradingview.com · RHO Navigator
          </span>
          <span class="screen-live"><span class="pulse" aria-hidden="true"></span>Live · 15-minute chart</span>
        </div>

        <div class="workspace">
          <!-- LEFT: chart -->
          <div class="chart-panel">
            <div class="chart-frame" aria-live="polite">
              <!-- viewBox common to all three states: 0 0 640 380 -->
              <svg viewBox="0 0 640 380" id="chart-svg" role="img"
                aria-label="A price channel with a support floor, resistance ceiling and dashed middle line. Green up and red down candlesticks move within it. A label pill marks where the Navigator signals a trade.">

                <!-- ===== BUY: rebound off support — buy fires after the bounce, ~halfway to the middle ===== -->
                <g class="cset active" id="panel-buy" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-buy">
                  <polygon points="40,96 600,68 600,300 40,328" fill="rgba(31,111,255,0.07)"/>
                  <line x1="40" y1="96" x2="600" y2="68" stroke="var(--cyan)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                  <line x1="40" y1="212" x2="600" y2="184" stroke="#9fbcff" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-dasharray="7 11" opacity=".85"/>
                  <line x1="40" y1="328" x2="600" y2="300" stroke="var(--cyan)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                  <text x="46" y="78" font-family="'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif" font-size="13" font-weight="700" fill="var(--cyan-light)">Resistance — the ceiling</text>
                  <text x="46" y="204" font-family="'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif" font-size="12" font-weight="600" fill="#9fbcff">Middle line</text>
                  <text x="46" y="312" font-family="'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif" font-size="13" font-weight="700" fill="var(--cyan-light)">Support — the floor</text>
                  <g class="candle" stroke="var(--down)" fill="var(--down)"><line x1="120" y1="150" x2="120" y2="178" stroke-width="1.6"/><rect x="113" y="156" width="14" height="18" rx="1.5"/></g>
                  <g class="candle" stroke="var(--down)" fill="var(--down)"><line x1="152" y1="172" x2="152" y2="206" stroke-width="1.6"/><rect x="145" y="178" width="14" height="24" rx="1.5"/></g>
                  <g class="candle" stroke="var(--down)" fill="var(--down)"><line x1="184" y1="198" x2="184" y2="238" stroke-width="1.6"/><rect x="177" y="204" width="14" height="28" rx="1.5"/></g>
                  <g class="candle" stroke="var(--down)" fill="var(--down)"><line x1="216" y1="232" x2="216" y2="284" stroke-width="1.6"/><rect x="209" y="238" width="14" height="38" rx="1.5"/></g>
                  <g class="candle" stroke="var(--down)" fill="var(--down)"><line x1="248" y1="270" x2="248" y2="314" stroke-width="1.6"/><rect x="241" y="276" width="14" height="14" rx="1.5"/></g>
                  <g class="candle" stroke="var(--up)" fill="var(--up)"><line x1="280" y1="246" x2="280" y2="294" stroke-width="1.6"/><rect x="273" y="252" width="14" height="34" rx="1.5"/></g>
                  <g class="candle" stroke="var(--up)" fill="var(--up)"><line x1="312" y1="232" x2="312" y2="268" stroke-width="1.6"/><rect x="305" y="240" width="14" height="22" rx="1.5"/></g>
                  <g class="candle" stroke="var(--up)" fill="var(--up)"><line x1="344" y1="208" x2="344" y2="244" stroke-width="1.6"/><rect x="337" y="214" width="14" height="26" rx="1.5"/></g>
                  <g class="candle" stroke="var(--up)" fill="var(--up)"><line x1="376" y1="182" x2="376" y2="216" stroke-width="1.6"/><rect x="369" y="188" width="14" height="24" rx="1.5"/></g>
                  <g class="candle" stroke="var(--up)" fill="var(--up)"><line x1="408" y1="160" x2="408" y2="192" stroke-width="1.6"/><rect x="401" y="166" width="14" height="22" rx="1.5"/></g>
                  <line x1="225" y1="346" x2="470" y2="346" stroke="var(--down)" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-dasharray="5 7" opacity=".8"/>
                  <text x="470" y="361" text-anchor="end" font-family="'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif" font-size="12" font-weight="600" fill="var(--down)">Stop — just below support</text>
                  <g>
                    <rect x="484" y="180" width="112" height="22" rx="11" fill="#0e1729" stroke="var(--up)" stroke-width="1.2"/>
                    <circle cx="498" cy="191" r="3.5" fill="var(--up)"/>
                    <text x="508" y="195" font-family="'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif" font-size="11.5" font-weight="700" fill="var(--up)">First target</text>
                  </g>
                  <g>
                    <rect x="484" y="64" width="112" height="22" rx="11" fill="#0e1729" stroke="var(--up)" stroke-width="1.2"/>
                    <circle cx="498" cy="75" r="3.5" fill="var(--up)"/>
                    <text x="508" y="79" font-family="'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif" font-size="11.5" font-weight="700" fill="var(--up)">Second target</text>
                  </g>
                  <g class="pill-group">
                    <line x1="364" y1="278" x2="307" y2="258" stroke="var(--up)" stroke-width="2"/>
                    <circle cx="307" cy="258" r="4.5" fill="var(--up)" stroke="#06280f" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                    <rect x="364" y="262" width="74" height="30" rx="15" fill="var(--up)"/>
                    <text x="401" y="282" text-anchor="middle" font-family="'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif" font-size="14" font-weight="800" fill="#06280f">Buy ▲</text>
                  </g>
                </g>

                <!-- ===== SELL: pullback off resistance — sell fires after the roll-over, ~halfway to the middle ===== -->
                <g class="cset" id="panel-sell" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-sell">
                  <polygon points="40,96 600,68 600,300 40,328" fill="rgba(31,111,255,0.07)"/>
                  <line x1="40" y1="96" x2="600" y2="68" stroke="var(--cyan)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                  <line x1="40" y1="212" x2="600" y2="184" stroke="#9fbcff" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-dasharray="7 11" opacity=".85"/>
                  <line x1="40" y1="328" x2="600" y2="300" stroke="var(--cyan)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                  <text x="46" y="78" font-family="'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif" font-size="13" font-weight="700" fill="var(--cyan-light)">Resistance — the ceiling</text>
                  <text x="46" y="204" font-family="'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif" font-size="12" font-weight="600" fill="#9fbcff">Middle line</text>
                  <text x="46" y="312" font-family="'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif" font-size="13" font-weight="700" fill="var(--cyan-light)">Support — the floor</text>
                  <g class="candle" stroke="var(--up)" fill="var(--up)"><line x1="120" y1="250" x2="120" y2="284" stroke-width="1.6"/><rect x="113" y="256" width="14" height="22" rx="1.5"/></g>
                  <g class="candle" stroke="var(--up)" fill="var(--up)"><line x1="152" y1="220" x2="152" y2="258" stroke-width="1.6"/><rect x="145" y="226" width="14" height="26" rx="1.5"/></g>
                  <g class="candle" stroke="var(--up)" fill="var(--up)"><line x1="184" y1="186" x2="184" y2="226" stroke-width="1.6"/><rect x="177" y="192" width="14" height="28" rx="1.5"/></g>
                  <g class="candle" stroke="var(--up)" fill="var(--up)"><line x1="216" y1="146" x2="216" y2="190" stroke-width="1.6"/><rect x="209" y="152" width="14" height="32" rx="1.5"/></g>
                  <g class="candle" stroke="var(--up)" fill="var(--up)"><line x1="248" y1="82" x2="248" y2="124" stroke-width="1.6"/><rect x="241" y="106" width="14" height="14" rx="1.5"/></g>
                  <g class="candle" stroke="var(--down)" fill="var(--down)"><line x1="280" y1="100" x2="280" y2="150" stroke-width="1.6"/><rect x="273" y="106" width="14" height="36" rx="1.5"/></g>
                  <g class="candle" stroke="var(--down)" fill="var(--down)"><line x1="312" y1="120" x2="312" y2="158" stroke-width="1.6"/><rect x="305" y="126" width="14" height="24" rx="1.5"/></g>
                  <g class="candle" stroke="var(--down)" fill="var(--down)"><line x1="344" y1="142" x2="344" y2="180" stroke-width="1.6"/><rect x="337" y="148" width="14" height="26" rx="1.5"/></g>
                  <g class="candle" stroke="var(--down)" fill="var(--down)"><line x1="376" y1="166" x2="376" y2="202" stroke-width="1.6"/><rect x="369" y="172" width="14" height="24" rx="1.5"/></g>
                  <g class="candle" stroke="var(--down)" fill="var(--down)"><line x1="408" y1="190" x2="408" y2="224" stroke-width="1.6"/><rect x="401" y="196" width="14" height="22" rx="1.5"/></g>
                  <line x1="225" y1="56" x2="470" y2="56" stroke="var(--down)" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-dasharray="5 7" opacity=".8"/>
                  <text x="470" y="48" text-anchor="end" font-family="'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif" font-size="12" font-weight="600" fill="var(--down)">Stop — just above resistance</text>
                  <g>
                    <rect x="484" y="180" width="112" height="22" rx="11" fill="#0e1729" stroke="var(--up)" stroke-width="1.2"/>
                    <circle cx="498" cy="191" r="3.5" fill="var(--up)"/>
                    <text x="508" y="195" font-family="'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif" font-size="11.5" font-weight="700" fill="var(--up)">First target</text>
                  </g>
                  <g>
                    <rect x="484" y="295" width="112" height="22" rx="11" fill="#0e1729" stroke="var(--up)" stroke-width="1.2"/>
                    <circle cx="498" cy="306" r="3.5" fill="var(--up)"/>
                    <text x="508" y="310" font-family="'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif" font-size="11.5" font-weight="700" fill="var(--up)">Second target</text>
                  </g>
                  <g class="pill-group">
                    <line x1="362" y1="118" x2="307" y2="148" stroke="var(--down)" stroke-width="2"/>
                    <circle cx="307" cy="148" r="4.5" fill="var(--down)" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                    <rect x="362" y="92" width="78" height="30" rx="15" fill="var(--down)"/>
                    <text x="401" y="112" text-anchor="middle" font-family="'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif" font-size="14" font-weight="800" fill="#ffffff">Sell ▼</text>
                  </g>
                </g>

                <!-- ===== BREAKOUT: a candle CLOSES above resistance, then the entry fires on the NEXT candle ===== -->
                <g class="cset" id="panel-brk" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-brk">
                  <polygon points="40,116 600,88 600,320 40,348" fill="rgba(31,111,255,0.07)"/>
                  <line x1="40" y1="116" x2="600" y2="88" stroke="var(--cyan)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                  <line x1="40" y1="232" x2="600" y2="204" stroke="#9fbcff" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-dasharray="7 11" opacity=".85"/>
                  <line x1="40" y1="348" x2="600" y2="320" stroke="var(--cyan)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                  <text x="46" y="96" font-family="'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif" font-size="13" font-weight="700" fill="var(--cyan-light)">Resistance — the ceiling</text>
                  <text x="46" y="224" font-family="'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif" font-size="12" font-weight="600" fill="#9fbcff">Middle line</text>
                  <text x="46" y="332" font-family="'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif" font-size="13" font-weight="700" fill="var(--cyan-light)">Support — the floor</text>
                  <g class="candle" stroke="var(--up)" fill="var(--up)"><line x1="110" y1="248" x2="110" y2="286" stroke-width="1.6"/><rect x="103" y="254" width="14" height="26" rx="1.5"/></g>
                  <g class="candle" stroke="var(--down)" fill="var(--down)"><line x1="142" y1="240" x2="142" y2="276" stroke-width="1.6"/><rect x="135" y="246" width="14" height="20" rx="1.5"/></g>
                  <g class="candle" stroke="var(--up)" fill="var(--up)"><line x1="174" y1="208" x2="174" y2="250" stroke-width="1.6"/><rect x="167" y="214" width="14" height="30" rx="1.5"/></g>
                  <g class="candle" stroke="var(--up)" fill="var(--up)"><line x1="206" y1="176" x2="206" y2="216" stroke-width="1.6"/><rect x="199" y="182" width="14" height="28" rx="1.5"/></g>
                  <g class="candle" stroke="var(--up)" fill="var(--up)"><line x1="238" y1="120" x2="238" y2="160" stroke-width="1.6"/><rect x="231" y="132" width="14" height="22" rx="1.5"/></g>
                  <g class="candle" stroke="var(--up)" fill="var(--up)"><line x1="278" y1="58" x2="278" y2="120" stroke-width="1.8"/><rect x="269" y="64" width="18" height="48" rx="1.5"/></g>
                  <g class="candle" stroke="var(--up)" fill="var(--up)"><line x1="320" y1="40" x2="320" y2="78" stroke-width="1.6"/><rect x="313" y="46" width="14" height="26" rx="1.5"/></g>
                  <g class="candle" stroke="var(--up)" fill="var(--up)"><line x1="352" y1="30" x2="352" y2="62" stroke-width="1.6"/><rect x="345" y="36" width="14" height="20" rx="1.5"/></g>
                  <line x1="260" y1="127" x2="580" y2="111" stroke="var(--down)" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-dasharray="5 7" opacity=".85"/>
                  <text x="580" y="142" text-anchor="end" font-family="'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif" font-size="12" font-weight="600" fill="var(--down)">Stop — just below resistance</text>
                  <g class="pill-group">
                    <line x1="438" y1="72" x2="320" y2="66" stroke="var(--cyan)" stroke-width="2"/>
                    <circle cx="320" cy="66" r="4.5" fill="var(--cyan)" stroke="#07101f" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                    <rect x="438" y="46" width="120" height="30" rx="15" fill="var(--cyan)"/>
                    <text x="498" y="66" text-anchor="middle" font-family="'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif" font-size="14" font-weight="800" fill="#07101f">Breakout ▲</text>
                  </g>
                </g>
              </svg>
            </div>

            <!-- caption changes with the tab -->
            <div class="chart-cap buy" id="cap-buy">
              <span class="badge">▲</span>
              <div>
                <h3>Buy the rebound</h3>
                <p>Price falls to the <b>support</b> floor and reacts. The Navigator does not buy at the floor. It waits for price to <b>rebound about halfway up to the middle line</b>, then prints <b>Buy</b>. The stop sits just below support; the first target is the middle line, then resistance.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="chart-cap sell" id="cap-sell" hidden>
              <span class="badge">▼</span>
              <div>
                <h3>Sell the pullback</h3>
                <p>Price rises to the <b>resistance</b> ceiling and reacts. The Navigator does not sell at the ceiling. It waits for price to <b>pull back about halfway down to the middle line</b>, then prints <b>Sell</b>. The stop sits just above resistance; the first target is the middle line, then support.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="chart-cap brk" id="cap-brk" hidden>
              <span class="badge">▲</span>
              <div>
                <h3>Catch the breakout</h3>
                <p>Price pushes through the ceiling. The Navigator waits for a candle to <b>close above resistance</b>, then prints <b>Breakout</b>, so you join the move once it is confirmed instead of guessing at the line. The mirror is a breakdown: a sell after price closes below support.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="legend" aria-hidden="true">
              <span class="chip"><span class="sw" style="background:var(--cyan)"></span>Support &amp; resistance</span>
              <span class="chip"><span class="sw dash"></span>Middle line</span>
              <span class="chip"><span class="sw" style="background:var(--up)"></span>Up candle</span>
              <span class="chip"><span class="sw" style="background:var(--down)"></span>Down candle</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- RIGHT: Telegram signal card -->
          <aside class="signal-col" aria-label="Example Telegram signal">
            <div class="tg-card">
              <div class="tg-head">
                <span class="tg-ava" aria-hidden="true">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M21.5 4.5 2.5 11.8c-.9.35-.88 1.65.04 1.96l4.7 1.6 1.8 5.3c.27.78 1.3.9 1.74.2l2.5-3.9 4.9 3.6c.6.45 1.46.12 1.62-.6L23.8 5.6c.2-.9-.7-1.5-1.5-1.1Z" fill="#38bdf8"/><path d="m7.3 15.4 9.3-7.4-7.5 8.6Z" fill="#7fe2ff"/></svg>
                </span>
                <div>
                  <div class="tg-name">RHO Navigator · US</div>
                  <div class="tg-meta">Signals group · 15-min</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="tg-body">
                <span class="tg-example">Example signal — not a live call</span>

                <div class="tg-signal-h" id="sig-h">
                  <span class="tg-pill buy" id="sig-pill">Buy ▲</span>
                  <span>zone reached</span>
                </div>
                <div class="tg-inst" id="sig-inst">AAPL · 15-minute chart</div>

                <div class="tg-rows">
                  <div class="tg-row">
                    <span class="k"><span class="tk" style="background:var(--cyan-light)"></span>Price</span>
                    <span class="v" id="sig-price">232.40</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="tg-row tp" id="sig-row-tp1">
                    <span class="k"><span class="tk" style="background:var(--up)"></span>TP1</span>
                    <span class="v" id="sig-tp1">236.10</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="tg-row tp" id="sig-row-tp2">
                    <span class="k"><span class="tk" style="background:var(--up)"></span>TP2</span>
                    <span class="v" id="sig-tp2">240.50</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="tg-row sl">
                    <span class="k"><span class="tk" style="background:var(--down)"></span>SL</span>
                    <span class="v" id="sig-sl">229.80</span>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <p class="tg-note">A signal quotes the price at the moment it fired. Have a look at the chart before you act on one.</p>
                <div class="tg-time"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"/></svg>Just now</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="screen-foot">
        <span class="ff"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 11l3 3 8-8"/><path d="M20 12v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9"/></svg>The same chart, three setups — tap a tab to watch each one</span>
        <span class="ff"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 18v-6"/><path d="M9 15h6"/><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="16" rx="2"/></svg>The signal also lands on your phone</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ WHAT YOU GET (ported from v3, scoped .port-get) ============ -->
  <section class="section port-get" id="get">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span>With your subscription</span>
        <h2>What you get <span class="hl">as a subscriber</span></h2>
        <p>The indicator is half of it. The other half lands on your phone through the week.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bento-get">
        <!-- lead tile: signals + sample telegram card -->
        <article class="get lead">
          <div class="ic" aria-hidden="true">
